WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.500
Connect your Mac, Linux, Windows, and iPhone with SpecWithCode Connect using one account sign-in and a one-time six-character device approval code.

00:10.000 --> 00:21.500
Open Settings, then Account, and sign in to SpecWithCode Connect. Your machine registers over the encrypted relay and appears online automatically with no IP addresses, join lines, or VPN setup.

00:22.000 --> 00:33.500
On your second computer, open Settings, then Machines, and pick Join one of your machines. Select the online host from your Connect account list and click Continue.

00:34.000 --> 00:45.500
The new machine displays a one-time six-character code valid for thirty minutes. Type that code into the approval prompt on the joined machine, then press Allow on the new machine to finish.

00:46.000 --> 00:55.500
To reach your computers from your iPhone, open Settings, Machines, and Your phone. Sign in on iPhone with the same Connect account and approve the one-time code on each machine you want to open.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
SpecWithCode Connect is separate from MCP tool servers, and Tailscale remains an optional direct fallback. Continue with the machine permissions and troubleshooting guides next.
